  "_comment": [
    "The SAME org, two months after the customer implemented checkout-SPEC.md.",
    "Paired with observed-customer.example.json to exercise gap/diff.py.",
    "",
    "What they fixed (all nine requirements from the generated spec):",
    "  - FR-001 renamed checkout.payment_authorize -> checkout.payment.authorize,",
    "    which closed the mid-funnel dark segment",
    "  - FR-002 added checkout.confirmation_viewed (the terminal span, so the",
    "    CE-002 grade cap is released)",
    "  - FR-003/004 checkout.outcome is now a string enum, not a boolean",
    "  - FR-005 payment.decline_reason now exists",
    "  - FR-006 order.value now exists, as a number",
    "  - FR-007 cart.value is now a number, so sum() and p50() work",
    "",
    "And one REGRESSION, deliberately: checkout.shipping_submitted disappeared.",
    "A refactor dropped it. This is the realistic failure mode — instrumentation",
    "rots quietly, and a report that only celebrates the wins would bury it."
  ],
